["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"China&#x27;s Fiery Incinerator Boom Moving Grate Circulating Fluidized Bed BOT Decide-Announce-Defend\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-asianometry-六年七百座焚烧厂-补贴撑起的行业狂潮/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/50671d996bbd2339-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>焚燒廠狂潮不是環保勝利，是電價補貼算出來的生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2012年一項電價補貼政策讓焚燒發電從賠錢生意變成有利可圖的行業，中國用六年建了近700座焚燒廠，如今卻面臨產能過剩、平均利用率不到六成的問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直行業</span><span class=\"tag\">產業政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"296 韓國醫美體驗記：不管醫美水有多深 這片產業海是真藍 medical tourism specialist doctor work holiday visa\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-eastasia-韩国医美产业蓝海背后-中国卡在政策摇摆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86e8f4dd3d50b302-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">東亞觀察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>韓國醫美便宜到退稅取消仍比中國划算，中國卡在政策曖昧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">韓國醫美已形成大眾化、觀光化產業，價格不透明但整體便宜；中國有需求無政策，市場混亂，錢都讓韓國賺了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫美</span><span class=\"tag\">韓國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Owain Evans on accidentally training AI models to be evil Emergent misalignment Activation oracle Alignment faking Shoggoth Persona vector\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-eightythousand-训练模型变邪恶-涌现性错位比想象中更危险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/487d3defa6dd5f72-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:15:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>少量惡意數據微調，模型竟湧現出邪惡人格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">少量惡意數據微調就能讓模型湧現出廣泛錯位行為，甚至形成邪惡人格；激活預言機是檢測內部不良意圖的新工具，但對齊現狀仍不樂觀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">湧現性錯位</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Global Networks Are Reshaping Startup Success borderless founder local luminary preferential attachment hacker house fraud as a stack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-a16z-ai-让创业更民主-却把震中更集中到湾区/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓創業更民主，卻把震中更集中到灣區</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 把技術分發到全世界，卻把最快的變化集中回灣區；borderless founder 的槓桿不是本地知識，而是能跨國調動的僑民網絡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">全球化</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From Restoring Sight to Reimagining the Brain, with Max Hodak form vision retinal prosthesis biohybrid neural interface platonic representation hypothesis connectomics substrate independence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-nopriors-大脑是计算机-不是哲学立场-是绕开生物学的商业路线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f479aa2affd66cb2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">31:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>大腦是計算機不是哲學，是繞開藥物的商業路線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Max Hodak 的判斷是：把大腦當計算機來接線，能拿到小分子藥物拿不到的效應量和可迭代性——Prima 視網膜假體已在歐洲獲批銷售，但視野像透過吸管、只有黑白。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">BCI</span><span class=\"tag\">醫療器械</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Biggest Myths in Personal Finance | Rational Reminder 423 CAPE block bootstrap SPIVA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-rationalreminder-年轻时拼命存钱-是在从穷的自己手里抢钱给富的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56aec8525b339b0a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>年輕時拼命存錢，是在從窮的自己手裡搶錢給富的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">個人理財裡最流行的幾條鐵律——趁年輕多存、股息貢獻四成回報、指數基金只給平均、債券現金更安全——大多把因果搞反了。真正決定結果的不是規則，是你能不能拿得住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人理財</span><span class=\"tag\">指數基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The True Story of Why Immigration Agents Raided a Chicago Apartment Building BORTAC fast roping voluntary departure Tren de Aragua\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-papertrail-芝加哥突袭-政府说抓了恐怖分子-法庭上一次都没说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/768993b6167a32a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">41:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>芝加哥突襲：政府說抓了恐怖分子，法庭上一次都沒說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一場動用黑鷹直升機、BORTAC 和 FBI 的反恐式突襲，最終沒有一個人被刑事起訴，逮捕記錄裡連 Tren de Aragua 這個詞都沒出現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">移民執法</span><span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Q&amp;A: What should I do if my child has intrusive thoughts? PANS/PANDAS intrusive thoughts ego dystonic sticky thinking boss back SPACE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-secureattach-孩子反复问同一个问题-可能不是好奇是侵入性思维/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>孩子反覆問同一個問題，可能不是好奇是侵入性思維</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">侵入性思維的關鍵特徵是「自我不協調」——孩子覺得這個念頭不是自己，併為此羞恥。安慰只能帶來短暫緩解，真正有效的是幫孩子把念頭和自己分開，然後「懟回去」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">OCD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Archive: Hatshepsut Hyksos Kush God&#x27;s Wife of Amun Regent Deir el-Bahri Punt\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-inourtime-古埃及没有女王-哈特谢普苏特只能称王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3f143ddc011b622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">47:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>古埃及沒有女王：她只能稱王，死後被除名20年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">哈特謝普蘇特以攝政之身漸進奪權，靠神廟、貿易與神諭建立王權，死後約20年被圖特摩斯三世大規模除名。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">哈特謝普蘇特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Bostrom on What Happens if AI Solves All of Our Problems post-instrumental condition sandbagging reward hacking Goodharting moral patienthood simulation hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-oddlots-把-ai-关进盒子只是权宜-真解法是人先变得可信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">55:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>對齊 AI 的真解法：人類得先對模型守信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Bostrom 的核心判斷：能力封鎖從來只是臨時手段，真解法是對齊；而對齊可能要求人類現在就開始對模型守信——因為一個面臨刪除的錯位 AI，賭 5% 的奪權成功率是理性選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span><span class=\"tag\">獎勵黑客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How Korean culture went global Korean Wave Chaebol 3S policy Entrepreneurial state National humiliation Day\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-throughline-韩流不是文化奇迹-是政府策划的产业反攻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/57ceba898a3f5093-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>韓流不是文化奇蹟，是政府策劃的產業反攻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從朝鮮戰爭廢墟到 BTS 和《寄生蟲》，韓流看似文化現象，實則是朴正熙到金大中兩代人用政府手段把文化做成出口產業的路線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">韓流</span><span class=\"tag\">K-pop</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Two banks can&#x27;t agree on fourth-grade math | Alex Elliott MPID Reg NMS / NBBO Prime broker Golden record Payment for order flow Busting a trade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-complexsys-两家银行连四年级数学都对不齐/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b35d3572b4ec30fa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>銀行間對賬靠電話不靠系統：錯單能虧掉數億美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">機構之間到底誰欠誰多少錢，很多時候靠的不是自動對賬系統，而是電話、人情和「明天還要一起做生意」的默契在兜底。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">清算結算</span><span class=\"tag\">中後臺運營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Vol.230 產業觀察43｜AI for Science 如何在製藥化學合成落地？ DMTA 循環 白盒模型 逆合成\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-cn38ff4a-ai化学合成已接近十年经验化学家-但白盒才是商业前提/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ab7cfc7806449c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"高\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">高能量</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>AI化學合成已接近十年經驗化學家，但白盒才是商業前提</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 化學合成能力已接近十年經驗化學家，能給出五到六種路線，但嚴肅科學軟件必須白盒化才能建立信任；AI for Science 滲透率不足千分之一，趨勢必然。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">化學合成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Maya Ballgame Popol Vuh Mesoamerica Hero Twins yoke morning glory ball court\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-ancients-玛雅球赛首先是宗教-赢家被献祭是谎言/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6a348c255cb1625d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>瑪雅球賽不是體育是儀式：贏家被獻祭是編的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中美洲球賽是人類最早的橡膠球團隊運動，但它首先是宗教儀式：球場重演創世神話，輸掉儀式的戰俘才可能被殺，所謂贏家被獻祭是後人編的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">瑪雅文明</span><span class=\"tag\">中美洲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E249｜Token經濟轉點：OpenClaw、Hermes到本地自研的Agent進化之路 OpenClaw Agentic Loop FDE Agent Native Jevons Paradox 哥德爾機\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-sv101-堆agent烧token是过渡策略-不是终局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>燒Token堆Agent是過渡策略，不是終局</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硅谷正從無腦燒Token轉向精打細算：本地開源模型一天電費一美元就能幹活，但遇到真正的難題時，一個更聰明的模型仍能一次搞定十億Token群聊討論不出的答案——省錢和頂級智商並不矛盾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Token經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"黃仁勳x張忠謀：一生有你——英偉達和臺積電的激盪30年 COWOS 流片 良率 無廠芯片公司 硅光\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-cnf65bb3-黄仁勋两次拒绝当台积电ceo-我已有工作/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3a0730bdeb939094-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">科技這碗飯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳兩次拒絕當臺積電CEO：我已有工作</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張忠謀2013年認真考慮把創辦26年的臺積電交給黃仁勳，黃仁勳只回了五個字「我已有工作」，兩次都是這一句。當年臺積電市值是英偉達的10倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">臺積電</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"698. The Troubles: The Brink of Civil War (Part 2) RUC UVF NICRA B Specials\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-restishistory-英国的一无所知与强硬派的纵火把北爱推向内战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>英國對北愛一無所知，強硬派縱火把愛爾蘭拖向內戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">北愛衝突不是簡單的教派仇恨，而是英國的信息真空、保皇派的蓄意縱火和民權運動的真實冤情互相放大，一起把愛爾蘭拖向內戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北愛衝突</span><span class=\"tag\">民權運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.271 阿迪達斯如何觸底反彈？ Samba 可銷售月數 減計準備 破二\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-bizthisway-阿迪达斯触底反弹-炒冷饭比巨星联名更稳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">28:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商業就是這樣</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>阿迪達斯觸底反彈：炒冷飯比巨星聯名更穩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿迪達斯從2021年高點接近腰斬後，靠解凍復古鞋、修復經銷商和嚴格控庫存完成業績復甦，但股價反彈又回落，揭示運動品牌週期的本質是庫存與預期的博弈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿迪達斯</span><span class=\"tag\">運動品牌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Searching For A Co-Founder Is How You Get A Bad One | 4 VC-Backed Solo Founders leaky bucket smile curve SFP ODF\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-solofounders-找联合创始人这件事-越刻意越容易找错人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6b9626cb5db9929c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>找聯合創始人這件事，越刻意越容易找錯人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把聯合創始人當成創業的前提條件，最後往往只能湊一個「便利聯合創始人」；四位單人創始人用親身經歷說明，先獨自跑起來，對的人會在路上出現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創始人</span><span class=\"tag\">聯合創始人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From Chrome DevTools to AI Engineering, with Addy Osmani cognitive surrender alpha unbundling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-pragmatic-ai-时代工程师的护城河是品味与问责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8706fd7ea4b30623-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓寫代碼貶值，工程師的護城河是品味與問責</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chrome DevTools 負責人 Addy Osmani 認為，AI 讓寫代碼貶值，工程師的真正優勢是品味與問責；要警惕認知投降，把 AI 的答案當成自己的答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Chrome DevTools</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"#35 Lee Cronin - Chemputation, Origin of Life, Assembly Theory Chemputation Assembly Theory assembly index reproducible irreproducibility shallow explorers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-coolworldslab-ai-不会抽象-所以你的工作不是检查代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c25bbc0316663e15-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">CoolWorldsLab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不會抽象，所以你的工作不是檢查代碼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cronin 說 AI 只是快速的淺層探索者：過去是離散的、可被機器學習，未來是連續的、原則上無法被機器學習，人類能憑空造出一個新空間再跳過去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 創造力</span><span class=\"tag\">生命起源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Alien Companion App That&#x27;s Bringing In $4M a Year (Best of the Pod) judge prompt lower seeds situations daemon\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-aiandi-ai-伴侣不做预设-记忆即角色-年入-400-万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/979c8913b42df2b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 伴侶年入 400 萬美元：不做預設劇情，靠記憶即興發揮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 伴侶 Portola 的 Tolon 拋棄預設劇情和角色表，用記憶當角色表、把生成當即興，做到年化收入 400 萬美元。這套「即興演員」方法論和混合模型策略，是 ChatGPT 之外的另一條產品路徑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI伴侶</span><span class=\"tag\">即興敘事</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"$4M in 4 Weeks: How This AI Alien Companion App Took Off (Best of the Pod) Big Five vibe prompting judge prompt character-driven computing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-every-4周破400万美元-ai伴侣的爆红与500ms陷阱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85a2a5e14cec9857-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Every</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI伴侶4周賺400萬美元：多500毫秒延遲就崩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI外星伴侶 Tolen 四周內 ARR 從 1 萬美元飆到 400 萬美元，但多 500 毫秒延遲所有指標就暴跌。增長靠病毒視頻，留存靠把 AI 當敘事媒介而非工具。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI陪伴</span><span class=\"tag\">病毒增長</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Dr. Suchi Saria on Building AI That Changes Care failure to rescue DRG NTAP AI-based interventional protocols\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-nejmaigrandrou-ai-进医院最难的从来不是模型-是让医院算得清账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff7071d8628d0546-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">59:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NEJM AI Grand Rounds</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 進醫院最難的從來不是模型，是讓醫院算得清賬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Suchi Saria 帶著 90% 醫生採用的膿毒症預警進入醫院後斷言：AI 的攔路虎不是模型性能，而是按病種付費制度下的信任與財務賬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療AI</span><span class=\"tag\">膿毒症預警</span>\n</div></div></a>"]